            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Yvette"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I agreed with the other comments about the soy sauce being too much. I also added extra mayo and honey to tame it. Next time I will try it without the soy sauce first.",
            "datePublished": "2020-09-17T22:05:06.347Z"
          },
          {
            "@type": "Review",
            "reviewRating": {
              "@type": "Rating",
