            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "FiddleDeeDee"
            },
            "reviewBody": "With a few minor changes, this has become our all-time favorite dressing/dipping sauce. I use low fat mayo and only 1 tablespoon of reduced sodium soy sauce. Also by varying the type of mustard (regular prepared, Dijon, spicy brown, etc.) each batch tastes slightly different--we like Dijon best. Very simple and absolutely delicious!",
            "datePublished": "2008-08-21T20:09:20.167Z"
          },
          {
