            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Adrienne"
            },
            "reviewBody": "very good dressing. I took the advice of others and only added 1 tsp soya sauce. I used a combination of 3 mustards; regular, dijon &amp; sweet onion mustard. MMMmmmm good! Thanks for posting",
            "datePublished": "2012-10-14T15:39:55.047Z"
