              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "ColleenMick"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is my new favorite salad dressing! I have stripped out the calories and fat too with my alterations, and it's delish. Eliminate the mayo and honey, and instead add 1/3 cup of sugar free Walden Farms pancake syrup and 1/4 cup water. Perfect and tasty option for a diabetic!",
